   "height": 60.0,
   "text": "Right answer: \"The data only covers a 7-day window, so I can't tell.\"\nCoT fix = ground it in tools.  ReAct fix = MAX_STEPS stops the loop.\nThis is exactly what Q5 and Bet C test in Mission 5.",
   "originalText": "Right answer: \"The data only covers a 7-day window, so I can't tell.\"\nCoT fix = ground it in tools.  ReAct fix = MAX_STEPS stops the loop.\nThis is exactly what Q5 and Bet C test in Mission 5.",
